    {
      "record_id": "T-CONCL",
      "role": "teaching_asset",
      "title": "微课：先标出作者真正想证明的句子",
      "target_skill_ids": [
        "xingce.judgment.argument.conclusion"
      ],
      "candidate_misconception_ids": [
        "M-CONCL"
      ],
      "independence_group": "argument-conclusion-teaching",
      "content_origin": "original_lumi",
      "review_status": "draft_unreviewed",
      "target_candidate_ids": [
        "M-CONCL"
      ],
      "teaching_content": "把“因此认为、说明、导致”等后面的判断圈为结论；之前的时间变化只是证据。削弱题要找使这个结论变得不可靠的信息，而不是重复背景。",
      "record_sha256": "4bc472aa037bd6e3323a869375ba6422686f870a88c288a8486ce865997be67f"
    },
    {
      "record_id": "T-CAUSE",
      "role": "teaching_asset",
      "title": "微课：同一时间发生的另一项变化是关键检查点",
      "target_skill_ids": [
        "xingce.judgment.argument.causality"
      ],
      "candidate_misconception_ids": [
        "M-CAUSE"
      ],
      "independence_group": "argument-cause-teaching",
      "content_origin": "original_lumi",
      "review_status": "draft_unreviewed",
      "target_candidate_ids": [
        "M-CAUSE"
      ],
      "teaching_content": "若论证把“先后出现”当作“由此导致”，优先寻找同期的替代解释。自动校验或延长开放时间都能单独影响结果，因此会削弱单一原因的断言。",
      "record_sha256": "b0eeca624f4bc554298a9ef85c543ae156ec2b93ed12e51f8753a68a08a3db17"
    },
    {
      "record_id": "T-SCOPE",
      "role": "teaching_asset",
      "title": "微课：试点证据不能自动覆盖所有情境",
      "target_skill_ids": [
        "xingce.judgment.argument.scope"
      ],
      "candidate_misconception_ids": [
        "M-SCOPE"
      ],
      "independence_group": "argument-scope-teaching",
      "content_origin": "original_lumi",
      "review_status": "draft_unreviewed",
      "target_candidate_ids": [
        "M-SCOPE"
      ],
      "teaching_content": "核对论证中的地点、时间和人群。一个大厅一个月的观察不足以直接推出所有大厅、所有时间都会如此；选项若揭示范围不匹配，可能削弱结论。",
      "record_sha256": "03c6b97df4c86ec7e22502e6219e868ff92a5b90ac3b2d5b1a6f9a69ec0d5b59"
    },
    {
      "record_id": "T-EVID",
      "role": "teaching_asset",
      "title": "微课：信息要能改变结论的可信度",
      "target_skill_ids": [
        "xingce.judgment.argument.evidence_strength"
      ],
      "candidate_misconception_ids": [
        "M-EVID"
      ],
      "independence_group": "argument-evidence-teaching",
      "content_origin": "original_lumi",
      "review_status": "draft_unreviewed",
      "target_candidate_ids": [
        "M-EVID"
      ],
      "teaching_content": "问自己：若这条信息为真，是否会让“提示牌导致下降”更难成立？字体颜色、入口整洁等若不能解释结果变化，多半与因果结论无关。",
      "record_sha256": "eb5a8711c2aae9de48c3772e0add1a4a9836e43c49c0ca9d874a11ebdeadc2f4"
    },
